---
import StudioLayout from '../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import RunefjordSpotlight from '../components/RunefjordSpotlight.astro';
---
<StudioLayout title="Runefjord — A Strategic Sloth original" description="Runefjord is our Viking sticker merge game for Android, in testing now. Merge, collect, and fill fjord scenes. Try the browser demo. A Strategic Sloth LLC game.">
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">GAMES / IN TESTING ON GOOGLE PLAY</p><h1>Runefjord.<br>Small stickers. Big sagas.</h1><p class="lede">Our next game takes the sticker merge of Tropic Tumble north, to a Viking fjord. A complete mobile game, with a browser demo you can try here.</p></section>
<RunefjordSpotlight detail />
<section class="section container compact"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WATCH THE TRAILER</p><h2>Thirty seconds<br>of Runefjord.</h2></div><p>Captured from the game, with its own music and sound.</p></div><video class="runefjord-trailer" controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/media/runefjord/trailer-poster.webp" aria-label="Runefjord trailer"><source src="/media/runefjord/trailer.mp4" type="video/mp4"/><a href="/media/runefjord/trailer.mp4">Watch the trailer</a></video></section>
<section class="section container compact"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MERGE / COLLECT / CREATE</p><h2>From the first merge<br>to your finished fjord.</h2></div><p>76 stickers, nine scenes, timed events, a daily Rune Dig, and a Saga Pass. The screenshots below come from the game.</p></div><div class="runefjord-gallery">{[['shot-1-merge','Merge stickers through jelly, painted, and shiny stages.'],['shot-2-scene','Place your collected stickers in painted scenes.'],['shot-4-chest','Finish a scene to level up and open the chest.']].map(([file,caption])=><figure><img src={`/media/runefjord/${file}.webp`} alt={caption} width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>{caption}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
<section class="section container" id="play"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TRY THE BROWSER DEMO</p><h2>A short voyage north.</h2></div><p>The browser demo runs purchases and ads in clearly labeled test mode. The Android version is in testing and is coming to Google Play.</p></div><div class="runefjord-demo" data-runefjord-demo><button class="button" type="button" data-runefjord-start>Load playable demo ▶</button><p>The game loads from Remi’s portfolio when you choose to play. Sound starts after interaction.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://remiclassic.github.io/remiresume/runefjord/game/index.html?debug=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the browser demo full screen ↗</a></section>
<section class="contact-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE GAME / A SECOND WORLD</p><h2>Have a game that deserves<br>a new theme?</h2><p>Runefjord shares its rules and code with Tropic Tumble. Reskins, branded versions, and mini-games in one studio.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/services/">Explore studio services ↗</a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
<script>
document.querySelector('[data-runefjord-start]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{
 const host=document.querySelector('[data-runefjord-demo]');if(!host)return;
 const frame=document.createElement('iframe');frame.src='https://remiclassic.github.io/remiresume/runefjord/game/index.html?debug=1';frame.title='Runefjord playable browser demo, purchases and ads in test mode';frame.allow='vibrate';host.replaceChildren(frame);
});
</script>
<style>.runefjord-trailer{display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;margin:0 auto;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#111}.runefjord-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px}.runefjord-gallery figure{margin:0;background:#e3e7ea;padding:20px;border-radius:12px}.runefjord-gallery img{width:100%;max-width:280px;margin:auto;border-radius:14px}.runefjord-gallery figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px}.runefjord-demo{min-height:250px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;background:#dde5ec;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px}.runefjord-demo p{font-size:13px;text-align:center}.runefjord-demo :global(iframe){display:block;flex:none;width:min(100%,412px);height:780px;max-height:85vh;border:0;border-radius:14px;background:#1b120c}@media(max-width:650px){.runefjord-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}.runefjord-gallery img{max-width:260px}.runefjord-demo{padding:12px}}</style>
